## What Problem This Solves

Fixes: configured model references and aliases can clear terminal output or forge extra report lines when operators inspect model selection.

## User Impact

User impact: aliases, text/image fallback lists, and model-selection status fields display control characters safely while retaining normal Unicode. JSON consumers and stored configuration keep the original values.

## Why This Change Was Made

Use the existing terminal sanitizer at text output boundaries, before styling. Both fallback commands share the same owner. No routing, auth, configuration schema, defaults, dependencies, or migration changes.

