| `border` | string | `"0.5pt solid #000000"` |
| `borderTop` / `borderBottom` / `borderLeft` / `borderRight` | string | Per-side borders |
| `colSpan` | number | `2` |
| `rowSpan` | number | `3` |
| `verticalAlign` | string | `"top"`, `"middle"`, `"bottom"` |
| `padding` | string | `"0.15cm"` |

### Lists

```javascript
